B.aN1=new A.cM("cobra","Monocled Cobra","Naja kaouthia",!0,"Identified by the round 'monocle' mark on its hood. Will raise its body and hood when it feels cornered.")
B.aN6=new A.cM("king_cobra","King Cobra","Ophiophagus hannah",!0,"The world's longest venomous snake; rare on campus but sighted near the green belt. Give it a wide berth.")
B.aMT=new A.cM("banded_krait","Banded Krait","Bungarus fasciatus",!0,"Broad black and yellow bands with a ridged back. Calm by day, active at night; its bite can be painless but is dangerous.")
