B.aNd=new A.cM("salazar","Salazar's Pit Viper","Trimeresurus salazar",!0,"Green with a reddish-brown stripe along each side. Lives in shrubs and low branches; never reach into foliage.")
B.aN_=new A.cM("red_necked","Red-necked Keelback","Rhabdophis subminiatus",!0,"Olive body with a red or orange neck, found near water. Its bite can cause serious bleeding; treat as venomous.")
