B.aMW=new A.cM("korros","Indo-Chinese Rat Snake","Ptyas korros",!1,"Slender, quick and olive-brown, often near water. Harmless; eats rodents and frogs.")
B.aN2=new A.cM("wolf","Common Wolf Snake","Lycodon aulicus",!1,"Small and banded \u2014 frequently confused with the venomous krait. Active at night around hostels.")
